<title>USA: Bedford Property Investors sets stock offer.</title>
<headline>Bedford Property Investors sets stock offer.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, Calif. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bedford Property Investors Inc on Monday said it has launched a public offering of 4.0 million common shares at 17-3/8 a share.</p>
<p>The offer is expected to close on Feb. 12.</p>
<p>Net proceeds of roughly $66 million will be used to repay debt and acquire additional properties.</p>
<p>Bedford Property Investors is a self-administered equity real estate investment trust  with investments in suburban office buildings and industrial properties concentrated in the western United States.</p>
</text>
